            </note>
            <note corresp="#d329-f4" n="9" xml:id="d329-f4-content">
                <p>For correspondence on this subject, see <ref target="#pg318">pp. 318</ref>
                    ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d329-f5" n="10" xml:id="d329-f5-content">
